What is the output of the following JavaScript code snippet?

```js
var x = 10;
function test() {
  console.log(x);
  var x = 20;
}
test();
```

Consider the following JavaScript asynchronous execution block. In what order will the letters be logged to the console?

```js
console.log('A');
setTimeout(() => console.log('B'), 0);
Promise.resolve().then(() => console.log('C'));
console.log('D');
```
